  {
   "mode": "section",
   "target": "overview.md",
   "section": "What this is",
   "body": "Motion Sensor Range is an Oxygen Not Included mod that makes the detection range of the vanilla Duplicant Motion Sensor adjustable from a slider in the building's side screen: 2 to 16 tiles in steps of 2, default 4 (the vanilla range). It adds no building of its own. A `RangeSlider` component is attached to the sensor prefab by a Harmony postfix and rewrites the sensor's detection area at runtime; the range is saved with the building, works with the vanilla copy-settings tool, and carries over from an under-construction building. It is a from-scratch rewrite of Cairath's Configurable Motion Sensor Range for the current game. Version 1.2.0 is released on the Steam Workshop (id 3804025857); `mod_info.yaml` sets `supportedContent: ALL` and `minimumSupportedBuild: 744825`, so it loads with every DLC."
